SUMMARY:The Business of Creativity: A Conversation with Cory Berger\, Chi
 ef Growth Officer\, Goodby Silverstein & Partners (GS&P) 
DESCRIPTION:Cory Berger is a recognized industry leader who has spent 20+
  years leading and growing some of the world's best creative agencies.  T
 oday Berger serves as the chief growth officer of GS&amp\;P\, where he ov
 ersees growth for the 250+ person agency\, widely regarded as one of the 
 industry's best. In three years he has rebuilt the agency's new business 
 operation and spearheaded its resurgence back to growth with wins includi
 ng American Express\, General Mills\, NBA2k\, Rao's\, Zaxbys\, and Empowe
 r. In 2026 GS&amp\;P was named to both the Adage Agency A-List and Fast C
 ompany's Most Innovative Companies in the World list.  The conversation a
 nd audience Q&amp\;A will be moderated by Media School senior lecturer Jo
 e Glennon. Hosted by The Media School and The Ad Club @ IU (https://www.i
 uadclub.com/).  Please RSVP (https://iubmsch-fireform.eas.iu.edu/online/f
 orm/index/rsvpcoryberger).
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p data-pm-slice="1 1 []">  Cory Berger is a
  recognized industry leader who has spent 20+ years leading and growing s
 ome of the world's best creative agencies.</p><p>  Today Berger serves as
  the chief growth officer of GS&amp\;P\, where he oversees growth for the
  250+ person agency\, widely regarded as one of the industry's best. In t
 hree years he has rebuilt the agency's new business operation and spearhe
 aded its resurgence back to growth with wins including American Express\,
  General Mills\, NBA2k\, Rao's\, Zaxbys\, and Empower. In 2026 GS&amp\;P 
 was named to both the Adage Agency A-List and Fast Company's Most Innovat
 ive Companies in the World list.</p><p>  The conversation and audience Q&
 amp\;A will be moderated by Media School senior lecturer Joe Glennon. Hos
 ted by The Media School and <a href="https://www.iuadclub.com/" target="_
 blank" rel="noopener">The Ad Club @ IU</a>.</p><p>  Please <a href="https
 ://iubmsch-fireform.eas.iu.edu/online/form/index/rsvpcoryberger" target="
 _blank" rel="noopener">RSVP</a>.</p>
