SUMMARY:Media Career Day 2026
DESCRIPTION:Explore careers in media! Media Career Day is an all-day\, an
 nual event that gives students the opportunity to connect with alumni to 
 learn about their career experiences. Expand your knowledge and professio
 nal network though panel discussions\, one-on-one career chats and a netw
 orking lunch with a featured speaker.Event ScheduleComing Soon!  &#160\; 
  Interested in having a one-on-one conversation with one of our Media Sch
 ool alumni? Sign up coming soon!  This event is Momentum eligible.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Explore careers in media! Media Career 
 Day is an all-day\, annual event that gives students the opportunity to c
 onnect with alumni to learn about their career experiences. Expand your k
 nowledge and professional network though panel discussions\, one-on-one c
 areer chats and a networking lunch with a featured speaker.</p><p><strong
 >Event Schedule<br /></strong>Coming Soon!</p><p>  &#160\;</p><p>  Intere
 sted in having a one-on-one conversation with one of our Media School alu
 mni? <strong>Sign up coming soon!</strong></p><p><br />  This event is Mo
 mentum eligible.</p>
